※ pl4g-test: module
※※ Macros a program beside this one invokes.

※※ What this module calls itself, which the macro below names.
@[export]
fn tag() → u8:
    7u8

※※ Twice over, written as rules.
@[export]
macro twice:
    ⌜$x⌝ → ⌜$x + $x⌝

※※ And one written as a function, which names something of this module.
@[export, impure]
macro mine(e: syntax) → syntax:
    ⌜tag() + $e⌝
